<title>USA: Kinnard Investments Inc Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Kinnard Investments Inc Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.97		    $0.11</p>
<p> Net			  5,970			658</p>
<p> Revs			25,212		   17,766</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,127		    6,271</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 Q4 includes gain on sale of PRIMEVEST Financial Services Inc, completed October 31, 1996. Excluding the gain and associated expenses, the net loss for the quarter was about $325,000 or $0.05/shr.  </p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 1.92		    $0.54</p>
<p> Net			 11,698		    3,376</p>
<p> Revs			99,977		   75,333</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,108		    6,230</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding the one-time gain and associated expenses on the sale of PRIMEVEST, full-year 1996 net income was about $5.4 million or $0.88/shr.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
